,19]],"links":[["Suffolk County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/new-york/suffolk-county"],["ARC or PLC in Suffolk County","/arc-plc/new-york/suffolk-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids shows May to June and June to July each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025, August to September ran 48% of normal on the middle of the grids, and June to July ran 62%. Grid 24827 had its driest year in 1965 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
